{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interview met Henk Trumpie over Atelier Struktuur 68, Den Haag, 14 Januari 2025"},{"typeName":"subtitle","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De oprichting van Struktuur 68, de samenwerking van het atelier met kunstenaars, waaronder Dick Elffers"},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Josephine Kymmell"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"University of Amsterdam"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Data Steward"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"University of Amsterdam"}},{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sanneke Stigter"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"University of Amsterdam"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interview met Henk Trumpie, die samen met Jacques van Gaalen Struktuur 68 oprichtte in 1968. Trumpie vertelt het verhaal over zijn carriere, het ontstaan van Struktuur 68 en de samenwerking met kunstenaars. De aanleiding van het interview is een scriptie over de conservering van een glassculptuur van Dick Elffers. Het productieprocess van Elffers wordt besproken, alsook het contact tussen Elffers en Trumpie. In het interview wijdt Trumpie uit over het artistieke klimaat in Nederland vanaf 1968, waarin hij samen met Jacques van Gaalen keramiek produceerde voor kunstenaars. Tot op heden (2025) wordt er keramiek geproduceerd in het atelier. De verandering en ontwikkeling die Trumpie heeft meegemaakt wordt toegelicht."},"dsDescriptionDate":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2025-01-23"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history (discipline)"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Art and Architecture Thesaurus"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"http:\/\/vocab.getty.edu\/page\/aat\/300054402"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ceramicists"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Art and Architecture Thesaurus"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"http:\/\/vocab.getty.edu\/page\/aat\/300025388"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Modern (style or period)"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Art and Architecture Thesaurus"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"http:\/\/vocab.getty.edu\/page\/aat\/300264736"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"monumental works (object genre)"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary